import{_ as e,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"The Glossary","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/90-术语词典.md","filePath":"en/90-术语词典.md","lastUpdated":null}'),a={name:"en/90-术语词典.md"};function r(s,t,d,l,c,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[o('<h1 id="the-glossary" tabindex="-1">The Glossary <a class="header-anchor" href="#the-glossary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;The Glossary&quot;">​</a></h1><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Document No.</td><td>90</td></tr><tr><td>Module</td><td>Appendices and Reference Materials</td></tr><tr><td>Core Keywords</td><td>glossary, core concepts, definitions, unified terminology, Hengyuan Universe</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="i-terminology-notes" tabindex="-1">I. Terminology Notes <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-terminology-notes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Terminology Notes&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This dictionary collects the core terms in the setting system of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, aiming to unify the use of terms across all documents and ensure the consistency and accuracy of conceptual expression. All terms are sorted by the first letter of their Chinese pinyin; each entry contains the term name, the English reference name (if any), the definition, and a brief explanation. This dictionary is a dynamically updated document, and new terms will be continuously added as the setting system expands.</p><h2 id="ii-the-core-terminology-table" tabindex="-1">II. The Core Terminology Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-core-terminology-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Core Terminology Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th>Term</th><th>Definition and Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Anchor</td><td>A stable node in the law network, serving as the coordinate benchmark that maintains the stability of plane laws, enables cross-plane connection and time regression. In essence, an Anchor is a high-density condensation of the universe&#39;s origin laws at a specific spatial location, possessing the ability of self-maintenance and calibration.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Anchor Symbiotic Civilization</td><td>A civilization form based on the Anchor mechanism as its technological foundation and symbiotic evolution as its core concept. It opposes the predatory cultivation system and advocates returning the right to choose fate and evolution to all living beings, achieving more work, more gain; self-growth; a path for everyone; and the common advancement of all races.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Hengyuan Universe</td><td>The abbreviation of &quot;Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe&quot;, the entire cosmic domain where the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization dwells and governs. It is a composite existence composed of four levels: the material planes, the energy layer, the consciousness domain, and the law network.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe</td><td>The full name of the Hengyuan Universe. &quot;Wanling&quot; (Ten Thousand Spirits) refers to all life forms possessing perception and evolutionary potential; &quot;Hengmao&quot; (Balancing Anchors) refers to the Anchor mechanism that maintains cosmic balance; &quot;Origin Universe&quot; emphasizes the essential attributes of taking origin laws as the foundation and symbiotic evolution as the direction.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Symbiosis</td><td>One of the core concepts of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, referring to different life individuals, races, and civilizations achieving common evolution through mutually beneficial cooperation, rather than predatory evolution at the expense of others.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Predatory Cultivation System</td><td>A cultivation method that achieves self-evolution by devouring the energy, fortune, and even origins of the weak. It is the system type that the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization firmly opposes, considered the root cause of accelerating cosmic entropy increase and frequent civilizational discontinuities.</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>The Three Hundred Origin Cultivation Systems</td><td>Orthodox cultivation paths directly extracted from the universe&#39;s origin laws and verified by Anchors, three hundred in total, divided into six major categories: Origin Deduction, Life Cycle, Spatial Legal Principle, Consciousness Ascension, Symbiotic Network, and Applied Engineering, with fifty systems in each category.</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>The Three Origin Foundations</td><td>The first three foundational systems among the three hundred systems — the Deduction Iteration System (No. 1), the Life Cycle System (No. 2), and the Spatial Legal Principle Dispatch System (No. 3) — the cultivation foundation of all other systems.</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Deduction Iteration System</td><td>The No. 1 Origin Cultivation System, characterized by a hundredfold cultivation deduction amplification, using the technical application of the Multiplying Fruit to enhance deduction ability a hundredfold, emphasizing the optimization of cultivation paths through deduction, verification, and iteration.</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Life Cycle System</td><td>The No. 2 Origin Cultivation System, centered on the virtuous cycle of life energy, emphasizing that the energy exchange between the cultivator and the environment must be cyclical rather than predatory.</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>Spatial Legal Principle Dispatch System</td><td>The No. 3 Origin Cultivation System, centered on the understanding and dispatch of spatial laws, the cultivation foundation of important applications such as cross-plane interaction, isolated space construction, and Replication Mirror technology.</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Multiplying Fruit</td><td>The Multiplying Fruit originating from the One Piece world, technically applied in the Hengyuan Universe, capable of enhancing a cultivator&#39;s deduction ability a hundredfold, the core auxiliary tool of the Deduction Iteration System. One of the opening buffs.</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>Output-Linked Contract Mechanism</td><td>The resource distribution mechanism of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, distributing cosmic cultivation resources to individuals or groups in the form of &quot;contracting&quot;; contractors obtain resource usage rights through labor and contribution, achieving more work, more gain.</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>20% Activation Strategy</td><td>The phased strategic goal of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization: activate 20% of all living beings in the universe to become Supreme Powers of the Plane in the early stage, using them as the backbone to drive the common evolution of the remaining 80% of living beings.</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>Supreme Power of the Plane</td><td>A powerful being who has cultivated to an extremely high realm and can independently maintain the law stability of a plane. It is the target of the 20% Activation Strategy and an important maintenance force of the Anchor network.</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>Law Network</td><td>The fourth level of the Hengyuan Universe&#39;s structure, the operating foundation of the universe&#39;s origin laws and the root foundation of Anchors. The law network runs through the entire universe and is the technical basis of all law operations (including spatial dispatch, time regression, and energy transformation).</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>Plane</td><td>An existence region defined by a relatively stable set of laws, possessing independent spatiotemporal continuity. Each plane has unique physical constants, energy density, time flow rate, and consciousness activity level.</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>Law Barrier</td><td>The law barrier separating adjacent planes, whose strength depends on the degree of difference between the law parameters of adjacent planes. Plane travel requires overcoming law barriers.</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>Law Fingerprint</td><td>A unique identifier generated by hash operations on the core law parameters of each plane, 128 bits in length, one of the core parameters of the plane coordinate system.</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>Observe First, Then Intervene Within Limits</td><td>The primary operational principle of time regression and cross-plane archaeology, requiring any regression or archaeology to first complete the pure observation stage, and only after confirming no major risks may limited intervention be conducted.</td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td>Replication Mirror</td><td>A high-precision replication device based on spatial legal principle laws, capable of performing a complete 1:1 replication of the target area without touching the original, the core equipment of the off-site archaeology scheme.</td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td>Isolated Space</td><td>An independent law region constructed through spatial legal principle dispatch technology, used to carry archaeological copies and serve as the workplace for archaeological personnel, completely separated from the external universe by law barriers.</td></tr><tr><td>23</td><td>Knowledge-Only Retrieval</td><td>The core principle of the archaeology protocol, meaning that during the archaeological process, only abstract knowledge and information may be obtained from the target object; no matter, energy, or living beings may be retrieved.</td></tr><tr><td>24</td><td>Information Purification</td><td>The technical process of thoroughly stripping the source plane law imprints carried in raw information and retaining only the pure semantic content, the key link in ensuring the safety of retrieved knowledge.</td></tr><tr><td>25</td><td>Time Paradox</td><td>The phenomenon in which causal logic becomes self-contradictory due to interference behavior during time regression operations, including the four major categories of parricide paradox, information paradox, ontological paradox, and event paradox.</td></tr><tr><td>26</td><td>Causal Chain</td><td>The continuous linear structure of causes and effects between events, a core concept of time laws. The core risk of time regression operations is the disturbance of the causal chain.</td></tr><tr><td>27</td><td>Symbiotic Constitution</td><td>The fundamental law of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, with the highest legal effect, establishing the civilizational foundation of opposing predation and advocating symbiosis, and the seven basic constitutional principles.</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>Equality of All Races</td><td>One of the seven basic principles of the Symbiotic Constitution, meaning that all life forms, regardless of race, cultivation level, or origin, are equal before the law.</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>Anomalous Life</td><td>Life forms that do not conform to the conventional definition of life and possess special existence forms, requiring identification and management according to the three-category standardized handling procedures.</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>Anomalous Energy</td><td>Energy forms that do not conform to conventional energy classification and possess special attributes and behavioral patterns, requiring classification and control according to the three-category standardized handling procedures.</td></tr><tr><td>31</td><td>Dark Replacement Entity</td><td>A special life form involving the ethical issue of dual-soul coexistence, requiring management according to the dual-soul ethics guidelines and the four-category branch handling rules.</td></tr><tr><td>32</td><td>Dual-Soul Ethics</td><td>Ethical guidelines for the coexistence of two souls within a Dark Replacement Body, the core being respect for the respective rights of the two souls and prohibition of forced fusion or elimination of either party.</td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>The Five Symbiotic Civilization Typologies</td><td>Five types of symbiotic societies divided based on the characteristics of civilizations in the real world: East Asian intensive type, Nordic welfare type, North American pluralistic type, continental European social type, and developing catch-up type.</td></tr><tr><td>34</td><td>The Four-Stage Ascension Path</td><td>The four-stage route for the overall ascension of the Hengyuan Universe: real-world foundation building → technology empowerment → consciousness evolution → interstellar symbiosis.</td></tr><tr><td>35</td><td>Reality as the Foundation</td><td>One of the fundamental positions of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, meaning the real world is the only real world, novel worlds are false thought experiments, fiction is supplemented by reality where insufficient, and what reality lacks is created by upgrading based on laws.</td></tr><tr><td>36</td><td>Symbiosis Index</td><td>A quantitative indicator for assessing the degree of integration of a civilization or individual with the symbiotic network, covering multiple dimensions such as resource sharing degree, collaboration frequency, and altruistic behavior ratio.</td></tr><tr><td>37</td><td>Anchor Assembly</td><td>The highest authority organ of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, composed of representatives of all races in proportion, exercising legislative power and the power to decide major matters.</td></tr><tr><td>38</td><td>Symbiotic Executive Committee</td><td>The highest administrative organ of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, responsible for the execution of the constitution and laws and daily governance.</td></tr><tr><td>39</td><td>Symbiotic Court</td><td>The highest judicial organ of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, independently exercising judicial power, responsible for constitutional review and the adjudication of major cases.</td></tr><tr><td>40</td><td>Plane Administration</td><td>A specialized organ under the Anchor Assembly, responsible for the maintenance of the plane coordinate master database, the approval of travel permits, and the management of cross-plane archaeology.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iii-terminology-usage-standards" tabindex="-1">III. Terminology Usage Standards <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-terminology-usage-standards" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Terminology Usage Standards&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>The terms included in this dictionary are standard terms, and all documents should give priority to the standard expressions in this dictionary.</li><li>The same concept must use the same term in different documents, and synonyms must not be arbitrarily substituted.</li><li>New terms generated in new settings should be promptly submitted to the Terminology Committee for review, and added to this dictionary after passing the review.</li><li>If the definition of a term is revised, the latest version of this dictionary prevails, and the revision content must also be recorded in the document version notes.</li><li>When citing a term, the full name may be used at its first appearance, and the abbreviation may be used subsequently, but the clarity of the meaning in context must be ensured.</li></ol><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The glossary is the linguistic cornerstone of the entire setting system. The unified terminology system ensures conceptual consistency among the hundred documents, enabling readers to switch seamlessly between different modules without comprehension ambiguity. As the setting system continues to enrich and improve, this dictionary will be continuously updated, always serving as the authoritative source of terminology for all documents.</p><h2 id="related-documents" tabindex="-1">Related Documents <a class="header-anchor" href="#related-documents" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related Documents&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>00-衡元宙宇宙总览 (Heng Yuan Zhou: Cosmic Overview)</li><li>02-锚点本源定义与本质 (Definition and Essence of the Anchor Origin)</li><li>99-文档版本与维护说明 (Document Version and Maintenance Notes)</li></ul>',12)])])}const g=e(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
